<p>Notes: a) Represents charges and costs associated with the company's adoption in fiscal year 1996 of SFAS No. 121 and with decision in January 1997 to close 10 stores.  For the fourth quarter, the after-tax impact of the charge was $13.5 million, or $1.31 per share and for the year, $20.7 million, or $2.00 per share. b) Related to severance expenses paid to certain senior officers and employees, and legal and other expenses associated with the July 1995 change of control.  For the year, the after-tax impact of the charge was $32.5 million, or $3.24 per share. c) Earnings per share presented on a fully diluted basis only, as differences from primary earnings per share not significant.  Fully diluted average shares outstanding for the fiscal quarter and year ended February 1, 1997 do not include 997,121 preferred shares, and fiscal year ended February 3, 1996 does not include 1,231,795 preferred shares as effect of inclusion of the additional shares would be anti-dilutive.</p>
